{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:53 2026-05-10 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"警員在酒家調查爆竊案。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/6804aa2b2a0086eb682f9e2d44ef41b4/2026-05/page_87.jpg\"/>\n<p>今日（10日）是母親節，元朗有食肆尚未大做生意，卻慘遭賊人爆竊。早上10時32分，安寧路38號商場地舖一間酒家的經理報案，指酒家遭賊人潛入，掠去一批飽魚和啤酒等。</p>\n<p>警員到場調查，發現酒樓的後門和門鎖被撬毀，經初步點算有最少共10箱鮑魚等貨品，以及少量啤酒失竊；相信賊人從後門進入酒樓犯案，得手後逃去。</p>\n<img alt=\"酒樓的後門及門鎖被撬毀。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d0d460dc3a9c0c8ff8e9a92c81403df/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4df2d5768dd4b4d7ac619602dfe77d1/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911_02.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc98f6166836f984fa44467f2903767d/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911_03.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b39842738da16b523a9679e1efa5dd09/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911_04.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f6e7c97522fdd77047d3025ac27021a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911_05.jpg\"/>\n<p>現場消息稱，酒樓的夾萬和收銀機沒有損失，警方正翻查閉路電視追緝賊人，涉案確實損失仍待點算。《星島頭條》向酒樓職員查詢事件，職員表示被偷去的鮑魚，每盒價值千多元。惟職員形容事件對母親節的酒樓生意，沒有影響。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員在酒樓內調查案件。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a85e1e09f222ea38ce104473e4c6f4c1/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911_06.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79ca94ab71895e8b1b5164b260eba02a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_120915911_07.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c0a59da3d6d03638ac2c2d59412055a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_121030301.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55d86425c1cb201e7d785b16285d150b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_121030301_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"酒樓後門被賊人撬開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e39cbb4f5f3ae49587e2f8e78a6a262f/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_121030301_02.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/386f37fff35676425bcc543fdeed3454/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_121030301_03.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dfe5507d50bc8f4b714f925e1567c87/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_121030301_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"還竊酒家位處商場地舖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8690a235815367f6bd0da17e4a201554/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260510_121439923.jpg\"/>\n<p><br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-10T05:17:36.062626+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}